      "writtenOn": "2021-02-04T02:07:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is because of change made in CL:2666523.\nBefore when PD task is suspended, the task still runs at the frequency of every 6ms and enter code in suspended section. After CL:2666523, suspended PD task no longer runs until explicitly wake it up. So I have to add tc_start_event_loop(port); for \"update limited\".",
